.param Phi_target=6 s0=0.008 lambda_lev=0.01 alpha_mkup=0.8
KF4 L_cons Domestic_demand -0.4
KF1 Revenue Investment -0.4
* Labour Market Parameters
.param tau_C=0.183 tau_N=0.122 tau_K=0.30 tau_D=0.0 tau_Wh=0.118 tau_Wf=0.219
* Wage ($/Year)
* Consumption ($/Year)
* Tax rates
* Fiscal Authority
.param alpha_prod=0.36 delta_k=0.000833
.param K0=33.6 Y_ss=133m
.param R_star=0.024 Kp=0.06 Ki=0.44 R_elb=-0.005 Kd=1.5
* Exported goods (#/Year)
* Imported goods (#/year)
* Household investment ($/time)
.ic I(Income)=85m I(L_Cons)=20m I(Savings)=10m
KH1 Income Savings -0.4
.param t_start=120
.ic V(n_rate)=0.02
.param chi_W=0.635 chiT_W=1.0 pi_bar=0.02 g_z=0.01 tau_P=104
* NFC
* Capital producers
* Interest Rate Expense ($/Time)
* Interest Rate income (#/Time)
